From: CoreXGT <aulia.ikbal09@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:35:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] base: declare config_nightDisplayAvailable (cm-13.0 shim)

cm-13.0 port shim.

The nikel device tree ships cm-14.1 era overlays.
frameworks/base/core/res/res/values/config.xml is one of them and it
overrides config_nightDisplayAvailable, a resource that only exists in
cm-14.1.

aapt refuses an overlay that references a resource the base package does
not have ("Resource at ... appears in overlay but not in the base
package"), which fails the framework-res build with:

  error: Resource at config_nightDisplayAvailable appears in overlay but
  not in the base package; use <add-resource> to add.

Night display does not exist on Android 6.0.1, so the resource is only
declared so aapt accepts the overlay; nothing in the framework reads it.

Change-Id: I0000000000000000000000000000000000000001
---
 core/res/res/values/config.xml | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/res/res/values/config.xml b/core/res/res/values/config.xml
--- a/core/res/res/values/config.xml
+++ b/core/res/res/values/config.xml
@@ -1069,7 +1069,12 @@
     <!-- Minimum screen brightness setting allowed by the power manager.
          The user is forbidden from setting the brightness below this level. -->
     <integer name="config_screenBrightnessSettingMinimum">10</integer>
+
+    <!-- nikel cm-13.0: night display does not exist on Android 6.0.1, but the
+         nikel overlay (written for cm-14.1) overrides this resource. Declare
+         it so aapt accepts the overlay; nothing in the framework reads it. -->
+    <bool name="config_nightDisplayAvailable" translatable="false">false</bool>
 
     <!-- Maximum screen brightness allowed by the power manager.
          The user is forbidden from setting the brightness above this level. -->
     <integer name="config_screenBrightnessSettingMaximum">255</integer>
